\noindent \text{(5.)} $\tr(B (\mathbbm{1} \otimes \PD) \dyad*{\Psi}) = \mathfrak{D}/2^{nk}$. %= (2^n)!/(2^{nk} (2^n-k)!) 
This is shown below the current proof. 


