\noindent \text{(5''.)} $\tr(B (\mathbbm{1}_{\color{gray}X} \otimes (\PD^{\text{loc}(e)})_{\color{gray}Y}) \dyad*{\Psi}) = \mathfrak{D}_e/2^{nk}$.
