    & \leq 1 - (1-\tilde \delta) \tr \big( B (\mathbbm{1} \otimes \PD^{\text{loc}(e)}) \dyad*{\Psi} \big) && \text{(from (2''.), (3''.), (4.))} \\
    & = 1 - (1-\tilde \delta)(\mathfrak{D}_e/2^{nk}) \leq 2 \tilde \delta. && \text{(from (5''.))}
