    \caption{Scaling behavior of the gradient norm on various landscape patches for the \texttt{mHEA}-model with $L=N$ layers. We average over 50 independent runs of random $\theta\sim\mathbb{P}_\theta$ and uniformly sampled Pauli strings $H=P$.}
