With the help of Table~\ref{tab:update-rules_rotations} one establishes that for every pair $(V,\Pi_1)$ of unsigned, single-qubit Pauli-operators, there exists an unsigned Pauli-operator $\Pi_2$ such that $\Pi_1\neq \Pi_2$ and
