\caption{Visualization of CKA similarity scores between pretrained model and unlearned model, evaluated on CIFAR10, 30\% Class unlearning scenario. CKA-feature and CKA-logit represent the CKA score computed on $f_\theta(x)$ and $\mathbf{m}_\theta$ respectively.}
\label{fig:CKA_cifar10_pretrained}
