In 3D, we conduct our von Neumann analysis with $\nu_1 = \nu_2 = \nu_3$ and $50^3$ evenly sampled wave Numbers. Figure \ref{fig:amplification-3D} shows the amplification factor. The schemes are stable up to a CFL value of The scheme is stable for CFL values of around $0.58 \approx 1 / \sqrt{3}$. 

